window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Loving them was a crime. Leaving them was survival.</p> <p>As the daughter of a ruthless crime lord, I knew the rules—<i>never</i> fall for the enemy. But that didn’t stop me from giving my heart to three dangerous, beautiful men from a rival family. We were young, reckless, and willing to risk everything for each other.</p> <p>Until my father found out.</p> <p>His punishment was brutal. His message clear. And when I lost the life growing inside me, I knew I had to disappear—for their sake as much as mine.</p> <p>Four years later, they’ve found me.</p> <p>They’re furious. They want answers. They want <i>revenge</i>. And they want to make me pay for breaking their hearts.</p> <p>But when the truth comes out, their anger turns to something far more dangerous.</p> <p>Now, we have a new mission—destroy the men who tried to destroy <i>me</i>.</p> <p>The streets will run red before we’re through. And this time, we won’t stop until we’ve burned my father’s empire to the ground.</p> <p>Together.</p>"; 
